5,1,1,talk,Mio,,I’m worried we’re guessing again. We need to know exactly what our fixed costs are before setting any fee.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,Agreed. But we must also look at how members feel about showing up. Hesitancy is a real cost.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"I want to see who is actually doing the work. The same faces are everywhere, and it’s not fair.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The treasurer’s role is burning people out. We need to understand the administrative weight before we choose a method.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"I worry that if the entry fee looks too high, new people will just stay away. We need to keep it open.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Mio,,"@Toshio, if the admin work is too heavy, the whole system collapses. We need a stable baseline first.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Mio, stability is good, but if members feel they are paying for a privilege they hesitate to use, they will leave.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Jonathan, it’s not just about leaving. It’s about the people who stay and do everything. That’s the real problem.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"@Takumi, exactly. If the collection process is a nightmare, the treasurer quits. We need to minimize that friction.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Toshio, I hear you. But if we make it too complex to join, we lose the casual members who keep the vibe friendly.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,So we need data on both the money and the people. Let’s split the research tasks to cover all bases.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I will look at the attendance patterns. I want to see when the hesitation starts and how it affects turnout.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I’m going to check the sign-in sheets and the rota. I need to see the imbalance in who is actually present.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the treasurer’s logged hours and the bank statements. I need to see the true cost of the current system.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Kenji,,I’ll look at the taster evening forms and the mid-year joiners. I want to see what stops people from committing.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Mio,,"That sounds like a solid plan. We’ll have a clear picture of the financials, the workload, and the member sentiment.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Yes. Understanding the hesitation is key. If we can remove the friction of deciding to come, the club will breathe easier.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Takumi,,I’m not just looking for numbers. I’m looking for the truth about who is carrying the load. We can’t ignore that.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I will keep my focus on the mechanics. If the system is too hard to run, it doesn’t matter how fair it looks.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I’m hopeful. If we understand why people hesitate, we can design a fee that feels like an invitation, not a barrier.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
